step Dae'gun
  tip Work west back through Dae'gun: the Felguard Sentinels and Defiling Hounds are everywhere, the hounds carry the essence, and the Horde base's rubble (wire, scrap and dung) lies all over it. Light the two bonfires on your way, scout the Horde tower in the middle, take Azgalor's ashes west of the tower, and pick up the abandoned supplies, a few just north-west of Renalard and the rest in the western half: Renalard's tuft of fur, used on a demon, distracts it while you take them.
  tip Horde: the demons here also drop the Scraps of Horde Heraldry for Kal'tinzan, the old Horde Flag stands in the camp north of the south bonfire, and the Troll Remains at the camp's eastern edge start Tribal Colors.
  tip Careful: Legion Hulks (60, rare elites) stomp through Dae'gun's camps: give them room. Jezerelle the Swaying (61, rare) walks the camp north of the south bonfire: keep away from her.
  tip Careful: Doomguards (elites, 58-59) stand among the demons, and Doomguard Xarkul (elite, 61) walks the camp: pull the hounds and sentinels to you, away from them.
  kill 249229 x12 quest 95793.1         -- Felguard Sentinel
  collect 271220 x6 quest 92960.1       -- Ephemeral Essence
  collect 276100 x12 quest 97009.1 optional  -- Felhound Spike
  collect 250775 x5 quest 92011.1 @51.5,37.0  -- Frayed Wire
