step The Blackthorne camps
  when group 93584
  when onquest 92169
  tip The Blackthorne cultists camp on the slopes north-east of the Summit (level 60, with elite Outrunners, Priests and a Courier among them: pull carefully). Ve'han Talongrasp, an elite (level 60) who leads them, stands among them: leave him be. Ghansurok, an elite chimaera (level 61), also roams the ridge north of the camps.
  tip Use Tiala's staff on a Pact member to strip its ward, then kill it, ten times: pick Cultists and Adepts, whom Thisalee wants dead too. The Cultists carry the kris and the Adepts the staff; the thorn seeds lie in the woods there, and the hippogryphs and chimaeras roam the slopes all around. Not finished in our recordings yet: if something here is off, tell us.
